<title>UK: Argent sells property for 12.1 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Argent sells property for 12.1 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property developer Argent Group Plc said on Monday that it had sold its freehold on a London property for 12.1 million stg.</p>
<p>The property, let to BNB Resources, until 2054 has been purchased by Pickering Properties.</p>
<p>The rental income from the propert is 984,000 stg giving a net initial yield of 7.9 percent.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
